OL,3,GNEWSA'We have no interest in hearing   
OL,4,Afrom Huw Edwards', Downing Street says 
OL,6,F"Our thoughts first and foremost will  
OL,7,Fbe with the victims of child sexual    
OL,8,Fabuse and exploitation. We have no     
OL,9,Finterest in hearing what he has to     
OL,10,Fsay," a Downing Street spokesperson    
OL,11,Fsaid.                                  
OL,13,F"There are extremely serious crimes and
OL,14,Fanyone convicted of them must face the 
OL,15,Fconsequences of their actions."        
